T*
(This Surface Use and Damage Agreement \("Agreement"\) is entered into on December 5, 2024) Tj
T*
(between Doris and Walter Kestrel, as joint tenants \("Surface Owner"\) and San Joaquin Oil) Tj
T*
(Company \("Operator"\).) Tj
T*
(Recitals) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHEREAS Operator holds oil and gas leasehold rights beneath the lands of Surface Owner) Tj
T*
(described as Section 14, Block 13, H&GN RR Co. Survey, Abstract No. 612, Ward County, Texas) Tj
T*
(\(80.00 acres\); and) Tj
T*
(WHEREAS the parties desire to set forth the terms governing Operator's use of the surface) Tj
T*
(for drilling and production operations;) Tj
T*
(Surface Damages \(Area of Disturbance\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operator shall pay Surface Owner $30,000.00 per well pad as initial surface damages within) Tj
T*
(the area of disturbance, plus $40.00 per rod for new roads and pipelines, and shall) Tj
T*
(separately compensate for damage to crops, livestock, fences, and improvements outside the) Tj
T*
(area of disturbance.) Tj
T*
(Location of Operations and Setbacks) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Well pads, tank batteries, and central facilities shall be located no closer than 500 feet) Tj
T*
(to any existing residence or water well without the Surface Owner's written consent.) Tj
T*
(Operator shall consult Surface Owner on locations before staking, fence all production) Tj
T*
(facilities, and control noxious weeds.) Tj
T*
(Interim and Final Reclamation) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operator shall perform interim reclamation of areas not needed during production \(replace) Tj
T*
(topsoil, control weeds, reseed\). Upon plugging and abandonment, Operator shall remove all) Tj
T*
(equipment, recontour to approximate original grade, replace topsoil, and reseed with an) Tj
T*
(approved mix within twelve \(12\) months \(final reclamation\).) Tj
T*
(Water and Environmental Protection) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operator shall not use fresh water from Surface Owner's wells or ponds without a separate) Tj
T*
(written agreement; shall take measures to prevent soil erosion and pollution of land, water,) Tj
T*
(springs, and ponds; and shall not release or discharge toxic or hazardous substances on the) Tj
T*
(property.) Tj
T*
(Insurance and Indemnity) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Operator shall maintain commercial general liability and environmental liability insurance) Tj
T*
(in commercially reasonable amounts and shall indemnify and hold Surface Owner harmless from) Tj
T*
(claims arising out of Operator's operations on the property.) Tj
